#Протокол_Code_Gap_Backlog_Feeder_V1<[
Базис:
  ioHasC code-gap analyzer (Phase 8) выдаёт CodeGapReport с untracked_export, orphaned_tur и missing_implementation entries.
  Work Graph rebuild нужен controlled feeder: gap report → reviewable WorkItem draft suggestions, не auto-promotion в backlog.
Вектор:
  Input: code-gap.report.v1 (compatible with ../project analyzeCodeGaps summary + entries).
  Output: code-gap.backlog-feed.v1 with suggestions[]:
  - suggestedWorkId, title, targetFiles, confidence (high|medium|low), gapKind, reason, provenance.source=code-gap-analyzer
  Promotion flow uses protocols/workgraph-draft-intake.bvc review gates.
  defer-vector-dsl-to-onebase-codegen остаётся explicit defer; feeder не создаёт codegen tasks автоматически для Vector DSL.
Цель:
  Existing code без step coverage становится видимым в Work Graph queue как reviewable drafts.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: code-gap-backlog-feeder-v1
  work.source: design-code-gap-backlog-feeder
  migration.source_repo: ../project
  migration.source_paths: src/scanner/codeGapAnalyzer.ts, scripts/code-gap-analyze.ts
  trace.status: verified
]>
